# Test: H2O MP2/cc-pVDZ single point with spherical harmonics
# Reference values (independent implementation):
#   HF energy:       -76.026763787333
#   MP2 correlation:  -0.204019508148
#   MP2 total:       -76.230783295480
# StudDFT agreement: dE(MP2) < 2e-8 Ha
#
%method  MP2
%basis   cc-pVDZ
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1
%spherical
%print_time

*geometry angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.117369
H   0.000000   0.757160  -0.469476
H   0.000000  -0.757160  -0.469476
*end
